{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202613H9YGEI941795141731.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市建局土瓜灣道項目，由信置及鷹君財團中標，作價遠低於市場預期。</p><p></p><p>財團以逾26.8億元出價，擊敗長實及中國海外，中標項目發展權。地盤位於土瓜灣道及榮光街，可建約1,080伙。</p><p></p><p>市建局發言人表示，幾間主要發展商均有參與投標，入標量與出價均在預期內，中標價也貼近市價。信置就指，項目鄰近土瓜灣站，為優質九龍用地，也是集團一年內投得第5幅地皮。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:24:02.187818+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.341017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:17:16.972018+00:00","content_hash":"ea33ce308108b01e27010e4f6a120250170a7d9119d1b5863d395d91e7bbb7ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:24:02.187818+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}